y, posiada dobrą pracę i luksusowy dom, który dzieli ze swoim przyjacielem Paolo (Edoardo Leo). Pewnego dnia do jego drzwi puka nastolatka (Rosabell Laurenti Sellers), która twierdzi, że jest jego córką. Z początku Andrea nie wierzy dziewczynie, jednak jego nieufność z biegiem czasu ustępuje. Postanawia przekonać się, czy nastolatka w rzeczywistości jest jego córką.","popularity":1.0364,"poster_path":"/syLE6HJxETRZOxErpMZm60M9YlB.jpg","release_date":"2013-03-14","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.965,"vote_count":325,"credit_id":"59863b16c3a3683234006bf3","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8BTufM1NnGuZS7sCHVKcDdvBrjO.jpg","genre_ids":[35],"id":54309,"title":"Notte prima degli esami - Oggi","original_language":"it","original_title":"Notte prima degli esami - Oggi","overview":"","popularity":0.9897,"poster_path":"/zc43153cFR9uqbxILOqZnuaByyB.jpg","release_date":"2007-02-14","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.473,"vote_count":696,"credit_id":"59d952e792514124c902f86f","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[35,10749],"id":56014,"title":"Maschi contro femmine","original_language":"it","original_title":"Maschi contro femmine","overview":"","popularity":1.7863,"poster_path":"/epD9iEIEwwY3cYMyThw6Unn3gJv.jpg","release_date":"2010-10-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.786,"vote_count":709,"credit_id":"59bd9761c3a3681bd4018f67","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/yvU1l7HILRc37D1oiJWkSbT7kFm.jpg","genre_ids":[35,10749],"id":41174,"title":"Tutto l'amore del mondo","original_language":"it","original_title":"Tutto l'amore del mondo","overview":"","popularity":0.8127,"poster_path":"/wNE6ix0dmNoiA6N5pwCJ4TbrDPB.jpg","release_date":"2010-02-24","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":86,"credit_id":"5a21eecdc3a3680b930ae89c","department":"Writing","job":"Story"},{"adult":false,"backdrop